{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8NhF2AzewV8zdwJuAx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HyXP7kkj8rZhLYVCvCwRgD","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-5llj0W/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>拾焙 Roastery · 独立咖啡烘焙工作室</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"拾焙 Roastery —— 小批量手工烘焙的独立咖啡工作室。精选单一产地咖啡豆，欢迎到店品尝。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a href=\"#top\" class=\"logo\">拾焙<span>Roastery</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"nav\">\n        <a href=\"#beans\">我们的豆子</a>\n        <a href=\"#philosophy\">烘焙理念</a>\n        <a href=\"#visit\">到店地址</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"top\">\n    <!-- Hero -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container hero-inner\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Small Batch · Single Origin</p>\n        <h1>每一锅豆子，<br>都值得被认真对待。</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">我们是一家位于城市街角的独立烘焙工作室。每周小批量烘焙，只为把一颗咖啡豆最本真的风味，带到你的杯中。</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a href=\"#beans\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">看看本季豆单</a>\n          <a href=\"#visit\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">来店里坐坐</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Beans -->\n    <section id=\"beans\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Our Beans</p>\n          <h2>本季豆单</h2>\n          <p>所有咖啡豆均来自可追溯的庄园与合作社，按季节轮换，烘焙后 3–21 天内为最佳赏味期。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bean-grid\">\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag light\">浅烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">埃塞俄比亚</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>耶加雪菲 · 科契尔</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">水洗 · 海拔 2,000m · 原生种</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">茉莉花、柠檬皮、蜂蜜红茶，明亮干净的尾韵。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥88 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:85%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag light\">浅烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">哥伦比亚</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>薇拉 · 粉红波旁</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">厌氧日晒 · 海拔 1,800m</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">草莓、荔枝、红酒般的酸质，甜感饱满。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥108 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:70%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag medium\">中烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">云南保山</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>高黎贡 · 卡蒂姆</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">蜜处理 · 海拔 1,500m</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">红糖、烤坚果、熟李子，温润平衡，适合日常饮用。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥68 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:45%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag dark\">中深烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">拼配</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>街角 · 意式拼配</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">巴西 × 危地马拉</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">黑巧克力、焦糖、榛果，油脂丰厚，加奶表现出色。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥72 <small>/ 250g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:20%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"bean-hint\">条形指示为酸度参考 · 店内可免费试饮当周所有豆子</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Philosophy -->\n    <section id=\"philosophy\" class=\"section section-dark\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Philosophy</p>\n          <h2>我们的烘焙理念</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"philo-grid\">\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">01</span>\n            <h3>小批量，勤烘焙</h3>\n            <p>每锅不超过 6 公斤，每周烘焙两次。宁可卖完，也不让豆子在货架上失去光彩。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">02</span>\n            <h3>为风味而烘</h3>\n            <p>没有固定曲线。每一支豆子都经过反复打样与杯测，找到最能表达它产地个性的那一条。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">03</span>\n            <h3>尊重源头</h3>\n            <p>优先与小农和合作社直接往来，以高于市场的价格采购，让好咖啡的链条能持续下去。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">04</span>\n            <h3>把咖啡变简单</h3>\n            <p>好咖啡不该有门槛。我们乐于分享冲煮参数，也欢迎你带着任何问题来聊。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <blockquote class=\"quote\">\n          “烘焙师不创造风味，我们只是不去打扰它。”\n          <cite>—— 拾焙主理人</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Visit -->\n    <section id=\"visit\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container visit-inner\">\n        <div class=\"visit-info\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Visit Us</p>\n          <h2>到店地址</h2>\n          <p class=\"visit-lead\">烘焙间与吧台在同一个空间。周末下午来，常能闻到刚出锅的豆香。</p>\n\n          <dl class=\"info-list\">\n            <div>\n              <dt>地址</dt>\n              <dd>上海市徐汇区安福路 123 号 1 楼<br><small>地铁 1 / 7 号线常熟路站 3 号口，步行约 6 分钟</small></dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>营业时间</dt>\n              <dd>周二至周五 10:00 – 19:00<br>周六、周日 09:00 – 20:00<br><small>周一店休（烘焙日）</small></dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>联系</dt>\n              <dd>电话 021-0000-0000<br>邮箱 hello@shibei-roastery.cn</dd>\n            </div>\n          </dl>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"visit-card\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"map-art\">\n            <span class=\"street s1\">安福路</span>\n            <span class=\"street s2\">武康路</span>\n            <span class=\"street s3\">常熟路</span>\n            <span class=\"pin\">拾焙</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>每周六 14:00 开放杯测体验，名额 8 位，欢迎到店预约。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <span class=\"logo\">拾焙<span>Roastery</span></span>\n      <p>© 2026 拾焙 Roastery · 用心烘好每一颗豆子</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1704,"cache_read_input_tokens":32320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1704},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13857631-3136-435e-9d20-278f3420e1a3","uuid":"f90ca0a0-cfe6-406c-9c4f-6aab04079751","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:20:46.281Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8Nf4JZQQiqhr5oWrY9","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01HyXP7kkj8rZhLYVCvCwRgD":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-5llj0W/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>拾焙 Roastery · 独立咖啡烘焙工作室</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"拾焙 Roastery —— 小批量手工烘焙的独立咖啡工作室。精选单一产地咖啡豆，欢迎到店品尝。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a href=\"#top\" class=\"logo\">拾焙<span>Roastery</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"nav\">\n        <a href=\"#beans\">我们的豆子</a>\n        <a href=\"#philosophy\">烘焙理念</a>\n        <a href=\"#visit\">到店地址</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"top\">\n    <!-- Hero -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"container hero-inner\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Small Batch · Single Origin</p>\n        <h1>每一锅豆子，<br>都值得被认真对待。</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">我们是一家位于城市街角的独立烘焙工作室。每周小批量烘焙，只为把一颗咖啡豆最本真的风味，带到你的杯中。</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a href=\"#beans\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">看看本季豆单</a>\n          <a href=\"#visit\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">来店里坐坐</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Beans -->\n    <section id=\"beans\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Our Beans</p>\n          <h2>本季豆单</h2>\n          <p>所有咖啡豆均来自可追溯的庄园与合作社，按季节轮换，烘焙后 3–21 天内为最佳赏味期。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bean-grid\">\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag light\">浅烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">埃塞俄比亚</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>耶加雪菲 · 科契尔</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">水洗 · 海拔 2,000m · 原生种</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">茉莉花、柠檬皮、蜂蜜红茶，明亮干净的尾韵。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥88 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:85%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag light\">浅烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">哥伦比亚</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>薇拉 · 粉红波旁</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">厌氧日晒 · 海拔 1,800m</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">草莓、荔枝、红酒般的酸质，甜感饱满。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥108 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:70%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag medium\">中烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">云南保山</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>高黎贡 · 卡蒂姆</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">蜜处理 · 海拔 1,500m</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">红糖、烤坚果、熟李子，温润平衡，适合日常饮用。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥68 <small>/ 200g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:45%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"bean-card\">\n            <div class=\"bean-top\">\n              <span class=\"roast-tag dark\">中深烘</span>\n              <span class=\"origin\">拼配</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3>街角 · 意式拼配</h3>\n            <p class=\"process\">巴西 × 危地马拉</p>\n            <p class=\"notes\">黑巧克力、焦糖、榛果，油脂丰厚，加奶表现出色。</p>\n            <div class=\"bean-foot\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥72 <small>/ 250g</small></span>\n              <span class=\"meter\" aria-label=\"酸度\"><i style=\"--v:20%\"></i></span>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"bean-hint\">条形指示为酸度参考 · 店内可免费试饮当周所有豆子</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Philosophy -->\n    <section id=\"philosophy\" class=\"section section-dark\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Philosophy</p>\n          <h2>我们的烘焙理念</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"philo-grid\">\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">01</span>\n            <h3>小批量，勤烘焙</h3>\n            <p>每锅不超过 6 公斤，每周烘焙两次。宁可卖完，也不让豆子在货架上失去光彩。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">02</span>\n            <h3>为风味而烘</h3>\n            <p>没有固定曲线。每一支豆子都经过反复打样与杯测，找到最能表达它产地个性的那一条。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">03</span>\n            <h3>尊重源头</h3>\n            <p>优先与小农和合作社直接往来，以高于市场的价格采购，让好咖啡的链条能持续下去。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"philo-item\">\n            <span class=\"philo-num\">04</span>\n            <h3>把咖啡变简单</h3>\n            <p>好咖啡不该有门槛。我们乐于分享冲煮参数，也欢迎你带着任何问题来聊。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <blockquote class=\"quote\">\n          “烘焙师不创造风味，我们只是不去打扰它。”\n          <cite>—— 拾焙主理人</cite>\n        </blockquote>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Visit -->\n    <section id=\"visit\" class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"container visit-inner\">\n        <div class=\"visit-info\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Visit Us</p>\n          <h2>到店地址</h2>\n          <p class=\"visit-lead\">烘焙间与吧台在同一个空间。周末下午来，常能闻到刚出锅的豆香。</p>\n\n          <dl class=\"info-list\">\n            <div>\n              <dt>地址</dt>\n              <dd>上海市徐汇区安福路 123 号 1 楼<br><small>地铁 1 / 7 号线常熟路站 3 号口，步行约 6 分钟</small></dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>营业时间</dt>\n              <dd>周二至周五 10:00 – 19:00<br>周六、周日 09:00 – 20:00<br><small>周一店休（烘焙日）</small></dd>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <dt>联系</dt>\n              <dd>电话 021-0000-0000<br>邮箱 hello@shibei-roastery.cn</dd>\n            </div>\n          </dl>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"visit-card\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"map-art\">\n            <span class=\"street s1\">安福路</span>\n            <span class=\"street s2\">武康路</span>\n            <span class=\"street s3\">常熟路</span>\n            <span class=\"pin\">拾焙</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>每周六 14:00 开放杯测体验，名额 8 位，欢迎到店预约。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <span class=\"logo\">拾焙<span>Roastery</span></span>\n      <p>© 2026 拾焙 Roastery · 用心烘好每一颗豆子</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
